            "flowContent": "<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,'Songti SC',SimSun,serif;font-size:1.42rem;line-height:1.82;color:#1a120c;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0.8rem;text-align:center;font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:0.35em;color:#6a4a30;opacity:0.85;\">✦ &nbsp;—&nbsp; ✦</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0.7rem;font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:#2a1408;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(60,35,20,0.35);padding-bottom:0.25rem;\">受难的山峰</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0.7rem;font-size:1.18rem;line-height:1.5;color:#5a4030;font-style:italic;\">贾斯珀·普里斯特　未出版手稿　据称与地狱之子起源相关</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75rem;line-height:1.82;text-align:justify;\">山峰上燃烧的受难与坠落。</p></div>",
